    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by a Cypriot legend, this linear single-player adventure unravels a tale of family, sacrifice, and redemption. Set within the depths of a massive, ancient cave, players must face mystical challenges, battle cursed undead pirates, and uncover secrets in a journey through a timeless story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Echoes Within is a story-driven, third-person action-adventure game set in 1930s Cyprus. Blending horror, parkour, and shooter elements, it tells the story of a family torn apart by greed. Play as Ann, a silent witness to echoes that claw through sanity and drag her toward a forgotten nightmare.\u00a0</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by a Cypriot legend, this linear single-player adventure unravels a tale of family, sacrifice, and redemption. Set within the depths of a massive, ancient cave, players must face mystical challenges, battle cursed undead pirates, and uncover secrets in a journey through a timeless story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Echoes Within is a story-driven, third-person action-adventure game set in 1930s Cyprus. Blending horror, parkour, and shooter elements, it tells the story of a family torn apart by greed. Play as Ann, a silent witness to echoes that claw through sanity and drag her toward a forgotten nightmare.\u00a0</p>",
